OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 107-year-old Dunkirk
OL,4,ARAF veteran
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid after the death
OL,7,Fof a 107-year-old who was present at
OL,8,Fboth Dunkirk and the D-Day landings.
OL,10,FColin Cole, from Gobowen in Shropshire,
OL,11,Fserved in the RAF during the war,
OL,12,Fspending four years carrying out sea
OL,13,Frescue missions before retraining as a
OL,14,Fteacher. He helped police monitor CCTV
OL,15,Funtil he was 105.
OL,17,FHis friend Mike Souttar said Cole was
OL,18,F"terribly intelligent" and a "total
OL,19,Fold-fashioned gentleman". Neighbour
OL,20,FBryan Davies said he had been a man
OL,21,Fwith a fascinating life story who loved
OL,22,Fto meet and talk to people.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
